p08 : US Blanks 6'0"P (2010 catalog vector extraction; target 36.2 L)
p97 : This is a close to medium tolerance blank excellent for Junior sizes. Adjusted thickness flow in the nose and tail makes this a perfect quick shape blank. The design was based off the 6’2P.
